{"4530610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Clutch Legend: FPS Career Simulator", "steam_appid": 4530610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Clutch Legend is an independent game inspired by esports and competitive tactical shooters. It is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by Valve Corporation. Counter-Strike is a trademark of Valve Corporation.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/3e9dd9946309536bbabd301c37e247f4.avif?t=1786869405\" width=1170 height=180 /></span><i>You're nobody. For now.</i> <br> <br><strong>Clutch Legend</strong> is an esports career simulator i<i>nspired by competitive Counter-Strike</i>. You are not running a club from above: you are building one player's career, week by week and round by round. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/b183b50e02114e7aa768763c77d555be.avif?t=1786869405\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras_big/b183b50e02114e7aa768763c77d555be.avif?t=1786869405 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/579ad03b51035d1c6c8a22cb77b67819.avif?t=1786869405\" width=1170 height=180 /></span><strong>Buy weapons, armor and utility</strong>. Navigate eco, force and full-buy rounds, receive drops from teammates, and face rotations, smokes, plants, retakes and clutches on a <i>tactical 2D map</i>. Play every round live or simulate the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/af08f9805b00ba46363cb6fedaee4098.poster.avif?t=1786869405\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/af08f9805b00ba46363cb6fedaee4098.webm?t=1786869405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/af08f9805b00ba46363cb6fedaee4098.mp4?t=1786869405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/57957404875fa9c6fe5da3c502879b39.avif?t=1786869405\" width=1170 height=180 /></span>Choose between IGL, Entry Fragger, AWPer, Support, Lurker and Rifler. Your role changes which stats define your OVR, how you behave in live rounds and what your team expects from you. Build a specialist, not a generic rating. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/a31f74343502c4055051637bfe9f52bd.avif?t=1786869405\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras_big/a31f74343502c4055051637bfe9f52bd.avif?t=1786869405 width=1560 height=876 /></span> <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/0f11cc3cdb2f18092aabf0e5c0b46de7.avif?t=1786869405\" width=1170 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon and Utility Mastery grow through actual use. Mastery, individual stats and Map Knowledge shape your performance; skins and buy priorities make the arsenal your own. <br>Set your investment across five attributes and plan your weekends in the Training Schedule. Effort, schedule and budget determine how your player develops.<br><br>    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/4fc9319f4064ac0973d2a440f70c8911.poster.avif?t=1786869405\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/4fc9319f4064ac0973d2a440f70c8911.webm?t=1786869405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/4fc9319f4064ac0973d2a440f70c8911.mp4?t=1786869405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/982c4b6cb432ec7be02f8e40b0b4add2.avif?t=1786869405\" width=1170 height=180 /></span><br>Offers reflect your performance, role OVR, fame and each club's needs. Compare salary, contract length, roster, ranking and ambition, then sign, decline or make a counteroffer, directly or through your PR Manager.<br>Build your personal staff. Nutritionists, Psychologists, Personal Trainers and PR Managers have levels, requirements, weekly costs and tangible career effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/5be52924fae8103f22ae0d56ea263024.avif?t=1786869405\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras_big/5be52924fae8103f22ae0d56ea263024.avif?t=1786869405 width=1560 height=974 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/aa2b5aa5822ba7129b1def033ce85e34.avif?t=1786869405\" width=1170 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb four competitive tiers, defend your Team A spot, and fight through Splits, regional playoffs, Majors and the Continental All Stars Tournament. Your trophies, awards, records and complete career remain in the Hall of Fame.<br><br><i>No shortcuts. Only decisions.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/a97e200bf0425e80f2c221d917d0562b.avif?t=1786869405\" width=1532 height=958 /></span><i></i> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Clutch Legend is an independent game inspired by esports and competitive tactical shooters. It is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by Valve Corporation. Counter-Strike is a trademark of Valve Corporation.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/3e9dd9946309536bbabd301c37e247f4.avif?t=1786869405\" width=1170 height=180 /></span><i>You're nobody. For now.</i> <br> <br><strong>Clutch Legend</strong> is an esports career simulator i<i>nspired by competitive Counter-Strike</i>. You are not running a club from above: you are building one player's career, week by week and round by round. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/b183b50e02114e7aa768763c77d555be.avif?t=1786869405\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras_big/b183b50e02114e7aa768763c77d555be.avif?t=1786869405 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/579ad03b51035d1c6c8a22cb77b67819.avif?t=1786869405\" width=1170 height=180 /></span><strong>Buy weapons, armor and utility</strong>. Navigate eco, force and full-buy rounds, receive drops from teammates, and face rotations, smokes, plants, retakes and clutches on a <i>tactical 2D map</i>. Play every round live or simulate the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/af08f9805b00ba46363cb6fedaee4098.poster.avif?t=1786869405\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/af08f9805b00ba46363cb6fedaee4098.webm?t=1786869405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/af08f9805b00ba46363cb6fedaee4098.mp4?t=1786869405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/57957404875fa9c6fe5da3c502879b39.avif?t=1786869405\" width=1170 height=180 /></span>Choose between IGL, Entry Fragger, AWPer, Support, Lurker and Rifler. Your role changes which stats define your OVR, how you behave in live rounds and what your team expects from you. Build a specialist, not a generic rating. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/a31f74343502c4055051637bfe9f52bd.avif?t=1786869405\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras_big/a31f74343502c4055051637bfe9f52bd.avif?t=1786869405 width=1560 height=876 /></span> <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/0f11cc3cdb2f18092aabf0e5c0b46de7.avif?t=1786869405\" width=1170 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon and Utility Mastery grow through actual use. Mastery, individual stats and Map Knowledge shape your performance; skins and buy priorities make the arsenal your own. <br>Set your investment across five attributes and plan your weekends in the Training Schedule. Effort, schedule and budget determine how your player develops.<br><br>    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/4fc9319f4064ac0973d2a440f70c8911.poster.avif?t=1786869405\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/4fc9319f4064ac0973d2a440f70c8911.webm?t=1786869405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/4fc9319f4064ac0973d2a440f70c8911.mp4?t=1786869405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/982c4b6cb432ec7be02f8e40b0b4add2.avif?t=1786869405\" width=1170 height=180 /></span><br>Offers reflect your performance, role OVR, fame and each club's needs. Compare salary, contract length, roster, ranking and ambition, then sign, decline or make a counteroffer, directly or through your PR Manager.<br>Build your personal staff. Nutritionists, Psychologists, Personal Trainers and PR Managers have levels, requirements, weekly costs and tangible career effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras/5be52924fae8103f22ae0d56ea263024.avif?t=1786869405\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530610/extras_big/5be52924fae8103f22ae0d56ea263024.avif?t=1786869405 width=1560 height=974 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.ste